        "Abstract": "The paper discusses the lack of cultural awareness in text-to-image generation models and proposes a methodology for collecting and processing a dataset to adapt the model to better understand Russian culture. The authors created a dataset of 200,000 text-image pairs and fine-tuned the Kandinsky 3.1 model, resulting in improved generation quality in the Russian cultural domain."
